<<<
4. Other)(others or another. The writers of the following sentences may be supposed to have hesitated between oiher & others; if they had decided for others, they would have been more in tune with modern usage; to say they would have chosen more correctly is hardly possible:—
===
4. *Other*)(*others* or *another*. The writers of the following sentences may be supposed to have hesitated between *other* & *others*; if they had decided for *others*, they would have been more in tune with modern usage; to say they would have chosen more correctly is hardly possible:—
>>>

